inverse of a function, we follow these steps:\n\n**Step 1:** Replace $f(x)$ with $y$:\n\n$$\ny=-\\frac{1}{2}x+3\n$$\n\n**Step 2:** Swap $x$ and $y$:\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{1}{2}y+3\n$$\n\n**Step 3:** Solve for $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-\\frac{1}{2}y+3 \\\\ x-3 & =-\\frac{1}{2}y \\\\ -2(x-3) & =y \\\\ -2x+6 & =y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4:** Replace $y$ with ${f}^{-1}(x)$:\n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=-2x+6\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-109452/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "15cd299b-c720-5bf6-814c-2bef2c839e48"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109452"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection/df9b5ee140b49beb7d07902a4173db0d77c0d1fd1a98f41b9c33d5b670a3029c" :answer/id #uuid "3ea4a59f-ebca-522f-906d-50ea7624c48e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-4}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection/cb5a85fa65a78ec2bb7da72042186856ccc1ba473d544d4db2ce51dc0c99f5bb" :answer/id #uuid "43b141f9-6946-5d56-b544-1ea5007a8fb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=6x-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection/b45635424ef7b3e282b763aa8263f773de3f5f4b2bb03648d800a8ca408be7d9" :answer/id #uuid "c0dddb18-c7a7-543f-80a0-326642b07334" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+4}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection/5fbc59f4e119ca7fa85a5684b533822f3c0ed272366bc6cf15d26d45738d46cc" :answer/id #uuid "26e1e967-66d2-5274-b9f5-d36d7111f80e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-6}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection/f8562283cdba53e2b8c479254680fa5beda961d403e6b85646452c4779c2b841" :answer/id #uuid "57678d5f-b695-5f27-9081-4270cfb0d7a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+6}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19229/selection" :answer-field/id