h $y$:\n\n$$\ny=-2ax-3\n$$\n\n**Step 2:** Swap $x$ and $y$:\n\n$$\nx=-2ay-3\n$$\n\n**Step 3:** Solve for $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-2ay-3 \\\\ x+3 & =-2ay \\\\ \\frac{x+3}{2a} & =-y \\\\ -\\frac{x+3}{2a} & =y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4:** Replace $y$ with ${f}^{-1}(x)$:\n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=-\\frac{x+3}{2a}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-109477/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "40a70c8d-dc8e-52bd-a679-ffd6d1940451"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109477"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection/ab529aa46cef07dcaa234d152c991c376f5ad1baa115b961e551103ad4f46f10" :answer/id #uuid "d7b699cc-8656-5fd8-8449-b81d2f9a833c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+7}{a}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection/940843852b98a967ddd9110cd2371a856d49f6d5e772d2ca34c858e97e4da7dd" :answer/id #uuid "cf548679-8b2a-58cb-98ad-12d6b4fed971" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+a}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection/fb85434823a1efee6acc63c2530387be4d5adac6723e0aa0b659101c84c9e45b" :answer/id #uuid "28ac7ff7-38ef-5c48-9ac2-665850728f64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-7}{a}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection/3af3fed0f96ae54bafa6d3c3e2c253161af481aea1b9b2db72949f33d6d34239" :answer/id #uuid "948e2739-6542-50ba-86d7-52000a790b11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-a}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection/55fedc2a19ade2ba4bba7542a5a46206c5368f9bb98a196831e65ac316801ae7" :answer/id #uuid "413bcc69-3575-56dd-bb08-30639bd256d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=7x-a" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35217/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "628b5316-2c86-5781-988c-46c188a37fe5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-fiel