n**Step 3:** Solve for $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =4y+3b \\\\ x-3b & =4y \\\\ \\frac{x-3b}{4} & =y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4:** Replace $y$ with ${f}^{-1}(x)$:\n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-3b}{4}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-35323/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "40a70c8d-dc8e-52bd-a679-ffd6d1940451"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-35323"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-35310"] :question/worked-solution "To find the inverse of a function, we follow these steps:\n\n**Step 1:** Replace $f(x)$ with $y$:\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{x}{a}+11\n$$\n\n**Step 2:** Swap $x$ and $y$:\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{y}{a}+11\n$$\n\n**Step 3:** Solve for $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{y}{a}+11 \\\\ x-11 & =\\frac{y}{a} \\\\ a(x-11) & =y \\\\ ax-11a & =y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4:** Replace $y$ with ${f}^{-1}(x)$:\n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=ax-11a\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-66876/selection/7d23fc7f2d9171ecc32f48c1990f4fb049088377e20e0047aa5edd50e6daa343" :answer/id #uuid "668f2e07-70d8-5349-adb1-55c9063d0482" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x-b}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-66876/selection/0f3cca803308939a2a776e3dd6082a73370c3733a2ef319ef3eb76028d831136" :answer/id #uuid "b9e98841-bf86-5cd2-9cee-4765fb8e898b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=2(x+b)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-66876/selection/13c4b04868d7359956351d46f8dff1c9ca84ac9b7ea4ce162976913b6ca2d891" :answer/id #uuid "7231edb9-accc-54c7-9bc5-47507b554bc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=2(x-b)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-66876/selection/23f3af7f22a06e5fff7433447222125f6dd761490bbc37204c7006a67ed585d5" :answer/id #uuid "f81730df-48c7-5686-bd26-c7d2a7335c4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :ans